---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping Policy | Kitchen And All" description="Shipping and delivery information for Kitchen And All orders in Kenya.">
  <section class="min-h-[60vh] bg-slate-50 px-4 py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl md:p-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-orange-600">Shipping Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">Shipping and delivery</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        <p>We deliver commercial kitchen equipment and fabricated items across Kenya. Delivery arrangements, costs, and estimated timelines are confirmed with you before your order is processed.</p>
        <p>Standard stock items are normally dispatched once payment has been confirmed. Custom-fabricated, made-to-order, or imported equipment may require additional preparation or lead time. Delivery timing can also vary by destination, availability, and transport conditions.</p>
        <p>Please ensure someone is available to receive and inspect your order. Any visible damage or missing items should be reported to us as soon as possible, with photographs where available.</p>
        <p>For a delivery estimate or an update on an existing order, contact us at <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="mailto:info@kitchenandall.co.ke">info@kitchenandall.co.ke</a> or <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="https://wa.me/254741045143" target="_blank">+254 741 045 143</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>